    {
      "id": "claim_d17630eba9cf42ceb77dd765e44e63bc",
      "statement": "Global application settings are validated against strongly typed Pydantic v2 schemas—including ServiceConfig, ModelConfig, TrainingConfig, IngestionConfig, MLflowConfig, ConformalConfig, and OODConfig—and cached in-memory via an LRU cache to prevent redundant disk I/O and validation overhead.",
