    {
      "id": "claim_98fae87753b84918b05d77f1cfcfb599",
      "statement": "The system implements a dual-pipeline pattern where the feature extraction pipeline feeds observation batches through a frozen vision backbone using deterministic evaluation transforms, partitioning the resulting dense representations into four stratified splits (train, validation, calibration, test) persisted as discrete PyTorch tensor files under data/embeddings/ on disk.",
